      "quote": "Eligible studies included participants from birth to 15 years and 11 months. Studies were required to use at least one ER measurement and report ER as an outcome variable. Both studies with and without group comparisons were eligible. ... Studies reporting on secondary literature (e.g. meta-analyses, reviews) were excluded.",
      "reason": "The text specifies the age range (0 to 15 years and 11 months), the requirement for ER measurement and outcome reporting, and the exclusion of secondary literature."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "No language restrictions were applied; studies in all languages were included.",
      "reason": "The text explicitly states that no language restrictions were applied."
