      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review does not report excluding studies specifically because outcomes were not measured versus not reported; exclusions were based on broader criteria like ineligible age groups or absence of an ER outcome measure."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_12",
      "quote": "This review focuses specifically on studies using behavioral observations and physiological measures ( n = 516).",
      "reason": "The review specifies the grouping of studies for synthesis based on the measurement type (behavioral observations and physiological measures)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "We initially preregistered an age range of 0 to 18 years. However, this age range was reduced to 0 to 15 years and 11 months due to the large number of eligible records identified.",
      "reason": "The authors provide a clear rationale for the restriction on the age range eligibility criteria."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

